<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading Friday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 35.03 to 6094.23, a record. The Dow rose 124.85 points for the week.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 1.91 to 378.32, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.20.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1319 to 1046.</p>
<p>Volume was 467,939,290, compared with 478,549,070 Thursday. For the week, volume was 2,168,889,290.</p>
